        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-4^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$",
          "worked": "6 p.m. is 2 hours earlier, so add back the temperature fall.\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\times2&=4\\\\-8+4&=-4\\end{align*}$$\nThe temperature is $-4^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$.",
